abstract: >-
  Interpreter edition of a bilingual Japanese–Indonesian and Indonesian–Japanese
  glossary for maternal and child health, perinatal care, obstetric emergencies,
  referral systems, telemedicine, and healthcare financing. Same terms as the
  general edition (DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24298767), with Japanese entries arranged
  in gojūon (kana) order. Educational reference only; not a substitute for
  clinical guidelines or professional medical interpretation.
